function AutomationPage(){const[running,setRunning]=useState(false);const[step,setStep]=useState(-1);const nodes=[['Order received','POS / Form'],['Validate & sync','ERP / Database'],['Notify customer','WhatsApp / Email'],['Refresh dashboard','BI / Management']];async function run(){if(running)return;setRunning(true);for(let i=0;i<nodes.length;i++){setStep(i);await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,700))}setRunning(false)}return <Layout><PageHero eyebrow="Automation Studio" title={<>Remove repetitive work from the <span className="grad">business process.</span></>} copy="Connect forms, ERP, POS, spreadsheets, WhatsApp, email, APIs and dashboards into reliable workflows."/><section className="section"><div className="wrap"><div className="flowWrap">{nodes.map((x,i)=><motion.div animate={{scale:step===i?1.04:1}} className={'flowNode '+(step>i?'done':step===i?'running':'')} key={x[0]}><span>0{i+1}</span><b>{x[0]}</b><small>{x[1]}</small>{step>i&&<CheckCircle2/>}</motion.div>)}</div><button className="btn primary runBtn" onClick={run}><Play/>Run Automation</button><div className="logPanel"><b>Execution log</b>{nodes.slice(0,step+1).map((x,i)=><p key={x[0]}><CheckCircle2/> {x[0]} {i===step&&running?'running...':'completed'}</p>)}</div></div></section><section className="section soft"><div className="wrap"><div className="kpiGrid four"><Kpi label="Manual Hours Saved" value="45 hrs/day" trend="illustrative"/><Kpi label="Automations" value="24" trend="active" icon={Zap}/><Kpi label="Success Rate" value="99.2%" trend="last 30 days" icon={ShieldCheck}/><Kpi label="Avg Runtime" value="18 sec" trend="-12%" icon={Clock3}/></div></div></section></Layout>}

